---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { ShieldCheck, Zap, Phone, HeartHandshake, ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Shayonam Digital - Bhavnagar, Gujarat"
  description="Learn about Shayonam Digital: an independent digital agency based in Bhavnagar, Gujarat. We build fast, reliable websites with direct developer communication."
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 border-b border-[var(--border-light)] bg-[var(--surface)]">
    <div class="site-container max-w-3xl text-center mx-auto space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--paper)] text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--amber-text)] border border-[var(--border-light)]">
        <span>About Our Agency</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold font-display text-[var(--ink)] tracking-tight">
        Built in Bhavnagar. Crafted for performance.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-[var(--ink-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        We are an independent digital agency creating bespoke websites and custom web tools for local businesses, clinics, manufacturers, and startups across Gujarat and India.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story & Philosophy -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[var(--paper)] border-b border-[var(--border-light)]">
    <div class="site-container max-w-3xl space-y-8 text-[var(--ink)] leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-display text-[var(--ink)]">
        Why we do things differently
      </h2>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
        Most small businesses in India struggle with their online presence for one reason: they hire agencies that install slow, bloated site templates packed with plugins that break within six months. The site takes 8 seconds to load on mobile data, the contact form stops working, and the original developer is impossible to reach.
      </p>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
        At Shayonam Digital, we take the opposite approach. We write lightweight, modern code that renders instantly on any mobile phone. We eliminate confusing technical jargon. And most importantly, when you have a question or need an update, you call the actual person who wrote your code.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border-light)] space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[var(--paper)] border border-[var(--border-light)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--amber-text)]">
            <Zap className="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-[var(--ink)]">Speed as a Core Feature</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--ink-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            Your customers browse on phones, often on variable 4G networks. If your website takes more than 2 seconds to appear, they leave. We engineer for 95+ mobile Lighthouse scores.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border-light)] space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[var(--paper)] border border-[var(--border-light)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--amber-text)]">
            <HeartHandshake className="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-[var(--ink)]">Direct Accountability</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--ink-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            No middle managers or outsourced call centers. We are located right here in Bhavnagar, Gujarat, and we are accountable for the work we ship.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border-light)] space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[var(--paper)] border border-[var(--border-light)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--amber-text)]">
            <ShieldCheck className="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-[var(--ink)]">Total Ownership</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--ink-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            You own 100% of your website code, domain, and graphics upon completion. No recurring platform lock-in fees or proprietary traps.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border-light)] space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[var(--paper)] border border-[var(--border-light)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--amber-text)]">
            <Phone className="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-[var(--ink)]">WhatsApp-First Workflow</h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--ink-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            We adapt to how business gets done in Gujarat. From quick design approvals to lead notifications, we communicate smoothly via WhatsApp and phone.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-[var(--surface)]">
    <div class="site-container max-w-2xl text-center mx-auto space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold font-display text-[var(--ink)]">
        Let us discuss your project
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--ink-muted)]">
        Have a question about a new website, a custom portal, or redesigning an older site? We would be glad to talk.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="btn-tactile inline-flex items-center space-x-2 py-3 px-6 rounded-lg bg-[var(--amber)] hover:bg-[var(--amber-hover)] text-[var(--ink)] font-bold text-sm shadow-xs"
        >
          <span>Get in Touch</span>
          <ArrowRight className="w-4 h-4" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
